MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

„One message to the helper and to each bridge of the chain." The ask the
asker sent may have been relayed on; on „yes, thank them", everyone further
down who answered is thanked too — each in their own conversation, in their
language, rung once, the asker named as each of them saved her. A chain is
read at most six deep (the relay cap). The same fixed line; no result, no
typed words.

